@baseUrl = http://localhost:5238

### ===== IAM =====

### IAM 1. Sign up (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Salazar",
  "email": "eduardo@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "+51999888777",
  "role": "Owner"
}


### IAM 2. Second user (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "firstName": "Lucia",
  "lastName": "Ramos",
  "email": "lucia@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "+51988777666",
  "role": "Staff"
}


### IAM 3. Duplicated email in English (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Copy",
  "email": "EDUARDO@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456"
}


### IAM 4. Duplicated email in Spanish (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Copia",
  "email": "eduardo@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456"
}


### IAM 5. Invalid data in Spanish (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es


{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Sin nombre",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}


### IAM 6. Get all users (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json


### IAM 7. Get user by id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Accept: application/json


### IAM 8. User not found (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/999
Accept: application/json


### IAM 9. Update user (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Salazar Ruiz",
  "email": "eduardo@petstock.pe",
  "phone": "+51999000111"
}


### IAM 10. Update with the email of another user in Spanish (409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es


{
  "firstName": "Eduardo",
  "lastName": "Salazar",
  "email": "lucia@petstock.pe",
  "phone": ""
}


### IAM 11. Update user not found in Spanish (404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es


{
  "firstName": "Nadie",
  "lastName": "Nadie",
  "email": "nadie@petstock.pe",
  "phone": ""
}


### IAM 12. Sign in (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en


{
  "email": "eduardo@petstock.pe",
  "password": "123456"
}


