### ===== Profiles =====

### P1. Create preferences (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": 1,
  "notificationsEnabled": true,
  "darkMode": false,
  "language": "es"
}

### P2. Duplicate for the same user in Spanish (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "userId": 1,
  "notificationsEnabled": false,
  "darkMode": true,
  "language": "en"
}

### P3. Invalid language in Spanish (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "userId": 2,
  "notificationsEnabled": true,
  "darkMode": false,
  "language": "fr"
}

### P4. Get all (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences
Accept: application/json

### P5. Get by id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences/1
Accept: application/json

### P6. Update (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "notificationsEnabled": false,
  "darkMode": true,
  "language": "en"
}

### P7. Update not found in Spanish (404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/preferences/999
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "notificationsEnabled": false,
  "darkMode": true,
  "language": "en"
}

### ===== Catalog =====
### Create a supplier (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyName": "Distribuidora PetFood S.A.C.",
  "contactName": "Luis Paredes",
  "phone": "+51911223344",
  "email": "contacto@petfood.pe"
}

### Supplier without company name in Spanish (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "companyName": "",
  "contactName": "Sin empresa"
}

