### ===== Inventory =====
### Create the stock of product 1 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "productId": 1,
  "currentStock": 25,
  "minimumStock": 5
}

### Duplicate stock of product 1 (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "productId": 1,
  "currentStock": 10,
  "minimumStock": 2
}

### Duplicate stock of product 1 in Spanish (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es

{
  "productId": 1,
  "currentStock": 10,
  "minimumStock": 2
}

